Package: ch2sim
Title: Chapter 2 Cross-Biomarker Simulation Study
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Kwan Ho", "Lee", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "kwlee@ucdavis.edu")
Description: Research code for the Chapter 2 correlated cross-biomarker
    extension of the within-host antibody kinetics model. Not part of the
    serodynamics package and not intended for release; it exists so the
    Chapter 2 functions can be loaded with devtools::load_all() instead of
    being sourced by path.
